      "videoOrder": 41,
      "sourceHash": "8e8edf22ee6101224d79c39672fb26d1482a716322bd2824c046d1cee600a8ef",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.751,
          "end": 3.39,
          "en": "Now this website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.39,
          "end": 6.21,
          "en": "this application is taking shape.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.21,
          "end": 10.061,
          "en": "Before we now dive into even more routing related features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.061,
          "end": 13.02,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that we can also navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.02,
          "end": 15.84,
          "en": "between these different pages by clicking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.84,
          "end": 18.87,
          "en": "on links and this cancel button and things like that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.87,
          "end": 21.21,
          "en": "which currently doesn't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.21,
          "end": 24.12,
          "en": "At the moment, we have to manually tweak the url.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.12,
          "end": 26.55,
          "en": "And the reason for that simply is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.55,
          "end": 28.704,
          "en": "that in all these components and pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.704,
          "end": 31.35,
          "en": "there aren't any real links yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.35,
          "end": 34.909,
          "en": "For example, in expense form this cancel button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.909,
          "end": 39.48,
          "en": "which is this cancel button we see on this modal here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.48,
          "end": 41.49,
          "en": "this cancel button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.49,
          "end": 43.17,
          "en": "is currently not leading anywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.17,
          "end": 45.826,
          "en": "Or to be precise, it is leading to the tbd,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.826,
          "end": 49.325,
          "en": "the to be defined page, which doesn't exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.325,
          "end": 52.44,
          "en": "And we're also using a regular anchor tag here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.44,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "which does technically work, but will lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 59.28,
          "en": "to a brand new request being sent in a brand new page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.28,
          "end": 61.585,
          "en": "and all the JavaScript code being downloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.585,
          "end": 65.49,
          "en": "as I already explained in the Remix essentials section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.49,
          "end": 69.53999999999999,
          "en": "So we might not want to use this default link tag here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.53999999999999,
          "end": 71.03999999999999,
          "en": "or this anchor element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.03999999999999,
          "end": 73.97,
          "en": "but instead we want to use that link provided by Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.97,
          "end": 77.76,
          "en": "which lets us stay in the single page application world",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.76,
          "end": 80.22,
          "en": "once the website has been loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.22,
          "end": 81.912,
          "en": "And therefore these are exactly the kinds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.912,
          "end": 84.12,
          "en": "of changes I now want to go through.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.12,
          "end": 87.63,
          "en": "And of course, as before, feel free to try this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.63,
          "end": 91.14,
          "en": "on your own and try to create some meaningful links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.14,
          "end": 93.39,
          "en": "between those different pages if you want to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.39,
          "end": 95.34,
          "en": "by using the link component and coming",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.34,
          "end": 98.88,
          "en": "up with paths that make sense for that link component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.88,
          "end": 102,
          "en": "Here's your chance to pause the video and thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102,
          "end": 104.72999999999999,
          "en": "I will tweak all these different components and pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.72999999999999,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "we have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 108.723,
          "en": "that all the things are linked up properly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.96000000000001,
          "end": 113.88,
          "en": "So did you succeed?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.88,
          "end": 115.89,
          "en": "Let's now do that together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.89,
          "end": 118.773,
          "en": "and I will indeed start here in expense form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.67,
          "end": 122.703,
          "en": "There, I wanna replace this cancel link here with the link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.703,
          "end": 125.73,
          "en": "component provided by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 125.73,
          "end": 129.39,
          "en": "So therefore we can import link from, and then it's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.39,
          "end": 132.168,
          "en": "at Remix run React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.168,
          "end": 135.06,
          "en": "We get the link component from that package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.06,
          "end": 138.24,
          "en": "And with that imported, we can use it here instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.24,
          "end": 140.493,
          "en": "of the anchor element like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.48,
          "end": 144.15,
          "en": "And the link component does not use the ref prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.15,
          "end": 147.99,
          "en": "but the to prop instead and the value of that prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.99,
          "end": 149.97,
          "en": "should not be tbd.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.97,
          "end": 152.67000000000002,
          "en": "But instead what, where do we want to go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.67000000000002,
          "end": 155.87,
          "en": "if this cancel link is clicked here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 155.87,
          "end": 160.59,
          "en": "Well, I essentially want to go back to just slash expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.59,
          "end": 163.572,
          "en": "and we got two ways of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.572,
          "end": 167.38,
          "en": "We can, for example, enter slash expenses here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.38,
          "end": 171.32999999999998,
          "en": "That will work if you now save this and I click cancel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.32999999999998,
          "end": 173.59300000000002,
          "en": "I go to slash expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.59300000000002,
          "end": 176.28,
          "en": "But there also is another approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 181.28,
          "en": "We can also use dot dot, and that's new.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.62,
          "end": 182.52,
          "en": "You might know that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 182.52,
          "end": 184.95,
          "en": "from a React router if you worked with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.95,
          "end": 188.1,
          "en": "but you don't know it from the Remix essentials section yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.1,
          "end": 190.425,
          "en": "What does this dot dot link do?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.425,
          "end": 193.89,
          "en": "Dot dot means the same as it does in your command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.89,
          "end": 196.628,
          "en": "prompt or terminal with the CD command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 196.628,
          "end": 200.026,
          "en": "If you type cd dot dot in your command prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 200.026,
          "end": 202.8,
          "en": "this means that you wanna move up one folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 202.8,
          "end": 206.7,
          "en": "to the parent folder of the folder you are currently in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.7,
          "end": 210.12,
          "en": "And the same is the case here for this link, dot dot means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 210.12,
          "end": 213.946,
          "en": "that you want to go to the parent route in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 213.946,
          "end": 217.209,
          "en": "So in our case, since the ad component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.209,
          "end": 220.77,
          "en": "for which this expense form is rendered, is a child route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.77,
          "end": 223.71,
          "en": "of expenses, because it's in that nested folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 223.71,
          "end": 226.47,
          "en": "which belongs to the expenses jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.47,
          "end": 229.74,
          "en": "dot dot would mean that we go up from this ad route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.74,
          "end": 231.3,
          "en": "to the expenses route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 231.3,
          "end": 233.935,
          "en": "So in our case to just slash expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 233.935,
          "end": 236.37,
          "en": "And this is simply an alternative.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 236.37,
          "end": 239.7,
          "en": "It's a way of writing this path in a relative way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.7,
          "end": 242.13,
          "en": "so that we could use this expense form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.13,
          "end": 243.24,
          "en": "in different places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 243.24,
          "end": 246.03,
          "en": "And we would always go up to the current route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 246.03,
          "end": 248.831,
          "en": "of the component in which we use this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 248.831,
          "end": 250.898,
          "en": "In this case, it doesn't really make a difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 250.898,
          "end": 255.03,
          "en": "because the only other place where we use expense form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 255.03,
          "end": 256.83,
          "en": "is the dollar sign id route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 256.83,
          "end": 259.343,
          "en": "which is all that child of expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 259.343,
          "end": 261.75,
          "en": "So going up one level there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 261.75,
          "end": 264.45,
          "en": "all it goes to the expenses route, and therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 264.45,
          "end": 268.05,
          "en": "it would still be the same as writing slash expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 268.05,
          "end": 271.47,
          "en": "But dot dot is a bit shorter and it's nice to learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 271.47,
          "end": 274.17,
          "en": "about this feature and being able to create such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 274.17,
          "end": 276.99,
          "en": "relative routes like this and knowing about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 276.99,
          "end": 280.5,
          "en": "this special path here is definitely not bad.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 280.5,
          "end": 282.6,
          "en": "So therefore here I'll go with dot dot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 282.6,
          "end": 285.78,
          "en": "and that as you will see also takes me to the parent route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 285.78,
          "end": 287.26,
          "en": "if I click it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 287.26,
          "end": 289.86,
          "en": "Now, let's also see what happens on the added page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 289.86,
          "end": 292.158,
          "en": "and for this I'll just load slash expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 292.158,
          "end": 294.488,
          "en": "slash expense one, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 294.488,
          "end": 297.18,
          "en": "and there cancel all it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 297.18,
          "end": 298.574,
          "en": "So that's nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 298.574,
          "end": 301.26,
          "en": "We won't worry about the save expense button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 301.26,
          "end": 303.63,
          "en": "right now because that will only become important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 303.63,
          "end": 306.66,
          "en": "later in the next course section once we again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 306.66,
          "end": 309.33,
          "en": "dive into data manipulation and fetching.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 309.33,
          "end": 311.223,
          "en": "So this is the first link added.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
